{"version":1,"content":"<p>路透社11月6日援引《The Information》報道稱，台積電正考慮跨足先進存儲器製造，擬研究生產3D DRAM。據兩名知情人士透露，這項規劃是在英偉達提出需求後啓動，目標是讓台積電在人工智能硬件供應鏈中獲得更大份額。報道還稱，相關工作由負責先進封裝業務的副總經理徐國晉主導。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1585504.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-09T10:01:36.581536+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":146,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-08T14:47:41+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-09T09:55:26.770622+00:00","content_hash":"bcf728464cb2ba67db1f6edbcc48fe48e78c7f62dc1012deed27314907082a00","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}